                        "entry_id": "6a61d1c5-be52-3e61-8cfc-5d4574200c3b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Purgative; inducing mental or physical catharsis."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b5ad4fc-ba04-4c1c-be00-dabe3f68d571",
                                "sense_id": "982fc05d-4698-3bf1-8452-69c916348267",
                                "text": "Shaving, my favorite activity, is very cathartic."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d4bb41c0-39e7-36a7-9c13-5b268fe66080",
                        "entry_id": "6a61d1c5-be52-3e61-8cfc-5d4574200c3b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "That which releases emotional tension, especially after an overwhelming experience."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c9f484e4-d695-40bf-9a70-3d43d2f9a6a7",
                                "sense_id": "d4bb41c0-39e7-36a7-9c13-5b268fe66080",
                                "text": "\"So, there are real opportunities to create real change with enforcement.\" Prosser describes how some of that change is also cathartic to those who have been directly affected by incidents on the railway, such as the families who have lost loved ones."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dfe292b6-2b21-4c8e-8c1f-bd232e891d99",
                                "sense_id": "d4bb41c0-39e7-36a7-9c13-5b268fe66080",
                                "text": "For some, Saturday’s protests were cathartic, a show of force and solidarity by progressives who had struggled to pick themselves up from last November’s election defeat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d2f9fd3f-8947-496d-abe7-a71a26311114",
                                "sense_id": "d4bb41c0-39e7-36a7-9c13-5b268fe66080",
                                "text": "I don’t know if [Kamala] Harris found writing 107 Days cathartic, but reading it certainly wasn’t."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
